  "releaseNotes": "AstraFlow 1.2.2:\n      - Adds real multi-target support for AstraFlow, AstraFlow.Mediator, AstraFlow.Mapper, and AstraFlow.Diagnostics.\n      - Core packages now ship netstandard2.0, net8.0, net9.0, and net10.0 assets.\n      - AstraFlow.Mapper.EntityFrameworkCore remains net10.0 because it follows EF Core 10.\n      - Includes compatibility-safe source changes for older target reference assemblies.\n      - See CHANGELOG.md for the full release history.",
